<td id="S5.T2.4.1.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">GRPO <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib39" title="" class="ltx_ref">Shao et al., 2024</a>)</cite></td>
