<section id="A1.SS1.SSS3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.1.3 </span>Pseudo Code of SAC-ERA</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To better illustrate the role of our method within the algorithmic framework, we present the pseudocode for a representative example, the Soft Actor-Critic (SAC) algorithm, adapted with ERA in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.1.5 FastSAC-ERA ‣ A.1 Implementation Details of Continuous Control Tasks ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Entropy Regularizing Activation: Boosting Continuous Control, Large Language Models, and Image Classification with Activation as Entropy Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS1.SSS4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">A.1.4 </span>Hyperparameters</h4>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the hyperparameters used in our experiments with SAC and PPO in Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ A.1.4 Hyperparameters ‣ A.1 Implementation Details of Continuous Control Tasks ‣ Appendix A Implementation Details ‣ Entropy Regularizing Activation: Boosting Continuous Control, Large Language Models, and Image Classification with Activation as Entropy Constraints" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a></p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Comparison of hyperparameters for SAC and PPO.</figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SAC</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">PPO</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" colspan="3"><span id="A1.T6.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Optimizer Settings</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Actor optimizer</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" colspan="2">Adam</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Actor learning rate</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" colspan="2"><math id="A1.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Critic optimizer</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">AdamW</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Adam</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Critic learning rate</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" colspan="2"><math id="A1.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Temperature learning rate</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">—</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Adam epsilon</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">—</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.8.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
