<td id="A1.T6.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Gradient clipping</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">—</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.9.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">0.5</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.10" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.10.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" colspan="3"><span id="A1.T6.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Network Architecture</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.11" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.11.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Actor/Critic network</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.11.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" colspan="2">3-layer MLP</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.12" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.12.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Hidden layer dimensions</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.12.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">(512, 512)</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.12.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">(64, 64)</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.13" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.13.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   Activation function</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.13.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">ReLU</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.13.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Tanh</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.14" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.14.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">   LayerNorm</td>
